===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|rear|guard}}. Attested in ''{{w|The Song of Roland}}'' c. 1150 ({{m|fro|rereguarde}}). {{doublet|en|retrogarde}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɹɪəɹˌɡɑɹd/}}
